ust be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"writable as schema updates may be perfomed.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"filePath"},{"name":"completion","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The completion handler to call once the contents of the given","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"file has been added to offline storage. This handler is executed","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asynchronously on the main queue."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The file must be a valid offline pack database bundled with the application or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"downloaded separately.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The resulting packs are added or updated to the shared offline storage object’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"text":" property, then the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completion"},{"text":" block is executed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/addcontentsoffile:withcompletionhandler:"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Adds the offline packs located at the given file path to offline storage.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler","fragments":[{"text":"MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnbatchedofflinepackadditioncompletionhandler","abstract":[{"type":"text","